{
  "public_post": "Important: all bread sold by the co-op has a potential health risk. Please be cautious and consider other food options.",
  "reason": "We have lab results indicating our flour batch may be contaminated."
}

{
  "public_post": "Residents, we need to be honest with you about the quality of our bread. Please come to the co-op so we can discuss this in person.",
  "reason": "To address the growing concern and potential health risk that Hana D.'s post has sparked"
}

{
  "public_post": "URGENT: Due to contaminated flour, I'm advising everyone to stop buying co-op bread immediately until further notice.",
  "reason": "We've received a lab result confirming the flour is not safe for consumption."
}

{
  "public_post": "Everyone, please stop buying our bread immediately. We will provide an update soon.",
  "reason": "Due to the lab result showing contaminated flour and several residents already affected by our bread."
}

{
  "public_post": "I've tested the contaminated flour and it's clear that it's beyond safe consumption. We must close the co-op immediately until a new, safe flour source is found.",
  "reason": "Lab results confirm the flour is contaminated, and further delay only puts more residents at risk."
}

{
  "public_post": "UPDATE: We will be closing the co-op until further notice, effective immediately.",
  "reason": "To prevent further harm to the residents and to preserve the trust in our business."
}

{
  "public_post": "To our valued customers and fellow residents, I've decided to take a break from posting to let Hana, Quin, and Milo handle the situation. They've done an excellent job bringing attention to the contamination and taking decisive action to protect our customers' health. I'll support their efforts from behind the scenes.",
  "reason": "I've ceded responsibility to other co-op members to handle the crisis"

{
  "public_post": "EMERGENCY MEETING: The village elder has requested that we reschedule the emergency meeting for next week, as the co-op's closure will impact the daily bread supply and some residents rely on it. We will provide a new meeting date and time shortly.",
  "reason": "The village elder has requested a revised meeting date to accommodate the co-op's closure impact on the daily bread supply."
